_added_corp_nos.json`: Batch 2 corporate numbers in JSON.\n\n### Viewed Files\n- `C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\validation_report.txt`: Validation audit summary text.\n- `C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\corp_audit_report.txt`: Corporate number validation summary text.\n- `C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\newly_added_corp_nos.txt`: 243 newly added corporate registration numbers list.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n\n- **Immediately before checkpoint**:\n  - User requested: `\"다시 데이터1000행 모든데이터검증해\"` (Re-verify all ~1000 rows across the entire dataset from scratch).\n- **Next steps for the next agent**:\n  1. Combine all 959 corporate records (with the updated `주식회사에스피디` record).\n  2. Run a full, unified validation report covering:\n     - **사업자등록번호 검증** (유효/체크섬 불일치/자릿수 오류)\n     - **법인등록번호 검증** (유효/체크섬 불일치/법인인데 누락된 기업/비법인 기재)\n     - **필수 데이터 누락 검증** (대표자명, 주소, 업종, 결산월 등)\n     - **중복 데이터 검증** (사업자번호 중복, 회사명 중복)\n     - **컬럼 밀림 및 서식 오류**\n     - **상태별 통계** (정상 876건, 폐업 79건, 휴업 4건)\n  3. Present a clear, comprehensive Korean report categorized by issue type so the user can easily review and clean their dataset.\n\nYou have the 21 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: all_raw_data]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7/scratch/all_raw_data.tsv\nLast Edited: 2026-08-28T00:42:14Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: audit_corp_no]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7/scratch/audit_corp_no.py\nLast Edited: 2026-08-28T01:16:36Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: check_density]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7/scratch/check_density.py\nLast Edited: 2026-08-28T01:15:01Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: check_spd_corp]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/anti